  "summary": "I am an entrepreneur and early-stage investor with experience co-founding companies in the media industry, including PEIQ, which has grown to about 80 employees. Together with my colleagues at buildery.vc, I have had the opportunity to invest in companies like Personio, Ivy, NavVis, Deskbird, and SimScale.\n\nI helped develop the CDTM study program, the most successful entrepreneurial hub in Munich, where alumni have founded around 200 companies. My educational background includes studying Business Administration at Ludwig-Maximilians-University Munich and the MIT Sloan School of Management.\n\nI am passionate about mental fitness and breathwork, and I enjoy sharing this passion through talks and workshops at companies and universities. I believe these practices are essential for leading a healthy, happy life with greater resilience to stress.\n\nIn my free time, I love spending time in the mountains, whether climbing, mountaineering, or skiing. I also enjoy running, cycling, and finding new challenges in sports.",
